Description: Katzenpost mixnet chat client (experimental)
 katzenqt is an experimental Qt group chat client for the Katzenpost mix
 network. It must not be relied on for security, anonymity, privacy,
 reliability, or message delivery, and offers no protection against data
 retention.
 .
 Note: pycrdt and katzenpost-thinclient are not yet packaged in Debian; this
 package depends on python3-pycrdt and python3-katzenpost-thinclient, which
 must be provided separately until they are packaged, so the application can
 import them at runtime.
